  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> represents the actual number of deflections in a converted galvanometer of resistance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi></math> and shunt resistance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math>. Then the total current <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi></math> when its figure of merit is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi></math> will be",
